The NIRA ended on June 15, 1935. The circumstances surrounding its termination were that the U.S. Supreme Court had ruled Title I of the Act unconstitutional in the case "Schechter Poultry Corp. v. United States" on May 27, 1935, making the issue of reauthorization moot.
